Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.53,0:00:11.53,Newman-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,{\blur10\fad(200,200)\pos(1992,208)}翻译/压制/字幕制作：HAF半个水果 已获得翻译授权
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.53,0:00:11.53,Newman-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,{\blur10\fad(200,200)\pos(1941.334,1873.333)}使用AI工具翻译，如有不准确的地方请在弹幕或评论区指正，谢谢！
Dialogue: 1,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.94,Enderman字幕中,,0,0,0,,{\blur15.0}大家好！
Dialogue: 2,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.94,Enderman字幕英,,0,0,0,,{\blur15.0}Hello everyone!
Dialogue: 1,0:00:01.24,0:00:08.14,Enderman字幕中,,0,0,0,,{\blur15.0}在这个视频里 我真的很想在我的真实电脑上测试新的2989恶意软件
Dialogue: 2,0:00:01.24,0:00:08.14,Enderman字幕英,,0,0,0,,{\blur15.0}In this video, I really wanted to test the new 2989 malware on my real computer.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:10.16,0:00:15.50,Enderman字幕中,,0,0,0,,{\blur15.0}如你所见 我有个叫“恢复”的注册表文件
Dialogue: 2,0:00:10.16,0:00:15.50,Enderman字幕英,,0,0,0,,{\blur15.0}So as you can see, I've got the reg file called restore.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:16.54,0:00:23.50,Enderman字幕中,,0,0,0,,{\blur15.0}这基本上是一个注册表文件 包含我恶意软件修改的所有注册表项
Dialogue: 2,0:00:16.54,0:00:23.50,Enderman字幕英,,0,0,0,,{\blur15.0}And it's basically the reg file with all the registry entries that my malware modifies.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:24.42,0:00:28.62,Enderman字幕中,,0,0,0,,{\blur15.0}所以你看 这就是这个文件
Dialogue: 2,0:00:24.42,0:00:28.62,Enderman字幕英,,0,0,0,,{\blur15.0}So as you can see, here's the file.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:29.24,0:00:31.58,Enderman字幕中,,0,0,0,,{\blur15.0}那我们就直接在真实电脑上运行它吧
Dialogue: 2,0:00:29.24,0:00:31.58,Enderman字幕英,,0,0,0,,{\blur15.0}Let's go ahead and run it on a real computer.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:32.16,0:00:33.52,Enderman字幕中,,0,0,0,,{\blur15.0}它会变得多卡？
Dialogue: 2,0:00:32.16,0:00:33.52,Enderman字幕英,,0,0,0,,{\blur15.0}How laggy is it gonna be?
Dialogue: 1,0:00:33.56,0:00:35.42,Enderman字幕中,,0,0,0,,{\blur15.0}因为它会弹出无数个窗口
Dialogue: 2,0:00:33.56,0:00:35.42,Enderman字幕英,,0,0,0,,{\blur15.0}Because it creates a billion windows.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:35.74,0:00:36.84,Enderman字幕中,,0,0,0,,{\blur15.0}我们来瞧瞧
Dialogue: 2,0:00:35.74,0:00:36.84,Enderman字幕英,,0,0,0,,{\blur15.0}Let's find out.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:26.00,0:01:27.76,Enderman字幕中,,0,0,0,,{\blur15.0}目前还不卡
Dialogue: 2,0:01:26.00,0:01:27.76,Enderman字幕英,,0,0,0,,{\blur15.0}No lag so far.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:29.16,0:01:30.38,Enderman字幕中,,0,0,0,,{\blur15.0}有意思
Dialogue: 2,0:01:29.16,0:01:30.38,Enderman字幕英,,0,0,0,,{\blur15.0}Interesting.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:32.18,0:01:33.78,Enderman字幕中,,0,0,0,,{\blur15.0}这说得通
Dialogue: 2,0:01:32.18,0:01:33.78,Enderman字幕英,,0,0,0,,{\blur15.0}That makes sense.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:51.00,0:01:55.92,Enderman字幕中,,0,0,0,,{\blur15.0}通知中心打不开 因为窗口抢占了焦点
Dialogue: 2,0:01:51.00,0:01:55.92,Enderman字幕英,,0,0,0,,{\blur15.0}The notification center does not open because the windows take focus.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:57.22,0:01:58.34,Enderman字幕中,,0,0,0,,{\blur15.0}嗯 就是这样
Dialogue: 2,0:01:57.22,0:01:58.34,Enderman字幕英,,0,0,0,,{\blur15.0}So yeah, there's that.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:29.61,0:02:31.01,Enderman字幕中,,0,0,0,,{\blur15.0}把那个小窗口给我
Dialogue: 2,0:02:29.61,0:02:31.01,Enderman字幕英,,0,0,0,,{\blur15.0}Give me the naglet.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.77,0:02:29.46,Enderman-CN-C,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\pos(1962.667,2018.333)}即将有强光闪烁！
Dialogue: 1,0:02:31.57,0:02:32.29,Enderman字幕中,,0,0,0,,{\blur15.0}好耶！
Dialogue: 2,0:02:31.57,0:02:32.29,Enderman字幕英,,0,0,0,,{\blur15.0}Yes!
Dialogue: 1,0:02:34.25,0:02:37.35,Enderman字幕中,,0,0,0,,{\blur15.0}这确实比在虚拟机上好太多了
Dialogue: 2,0:02:34.25,0:02:37.35,Enderman字幕英,,0,0,0,,{\blur15.0}That's genuinely significantly better than on the VM.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:38.43,0:02:39.59,Enderman字幕中,,0,0,0,,{\blur15.0}太棒了！
Dialogue: 2,0:02:38.43,0:02:39.59,Enderman字幕英,,0,0,0,,{\blur15.0}That's awesome!
Dialogue: 1,0:02:42.75,0:02:45.73,Enderman字幕中,,0,0,0,,{\blur15.0}所以 我真的很开心
Dialogue: 2,0:02:42.75,0:02:45.73,Enderman字幕英,,0,0,0,,{\blur15.0}So, um, I'm really happy.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:47.31,0:02:48.25,Enderman字幕中,,0,0,0,,{\blur15.0}你可能听得出来
Dialogue: 2,0:02:47.31,0:02:48.25,Enderman字幕英,,0,0,0,,{\blur15.0}As you can probably hear.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:50.29,0:02:53.81,Enderman字幕中,,0,0,0,,{\blur15.0}我有点遗憾通知中心被抢占了
Dialogue: 2,0:02:50.29,0:02:53.81,Enderman字幕英,,0,0,0,,{\blur15.0}I'm kind of sad the notification center gets hogged.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:59.17,0:03:01.19,Enderman字幕中,,0,0,0,,{\blur15.0}但如果有需要 我大概能修好它
Dialogue: 2,0:02:59.17,0:03:01.19,Enderman字幕英,,0,0,0,,{\blur15.0}But I can probably fix that if I wanted.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:07.02,0:03:07.66,Enderman字幕中,,0,0,0,,{\blur15.0}太漂亮了
Dialogue: 2,0:03:07.02,0:03:07.66,Enderman字幕英,,0,0,0,,{\blur15.0}Gorgeous.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:29.91,0:03:34.83,Enderman字幕中,,0,0,0,,{\blur15.0}我现在大概能在Word里运行任何东西了
Dialogue: 2,0:03:29.91,0:03:34.83,Enderman字幕英,,0,0,0,,{\blur15.0}I can probably run anything in Word right now.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:34.91,0:03:39.34,Enderman字幕中,,0,0,0,,{\blur15.0}我得稍微试一下 因为焦点被抢走了
Dialogue: 2,0:03:34.91,0:03:39.34,Enderman字幕英,,0,0,0,,{\blur15.0}I have to try a little because the focus is getting hogged.
Dialogue: 1,0:04:10.73,0:04:12.29,Enderman字幕中,,0,0,0,,{\blur15.0}蓝屏来了
Dialogue: 2,0:04:10.73,0:04:12.29,Enderman字幕英,,0,0,0,,{\blur15.0}Here comes the blue screen.
Dialogue: 1,0:04:16.87,0:04:18.01,Enderman字幕中,,0,0,0,,{\blur15.0}出现了
Dialogue: 2,0:04:16.87,0:04:18.01,Enderman字幕英,,0,0,0,,{\blur15.0}There it is.
Dialogue: 1,0:04:19.53,0:04:20.97,Enderman字幕中,,0,0,0,,{\blur15.0}在真实硬件上
Dialogue: 2,0:04:19.53,0:04:20.97,Enderman字幕英,,0,0,0,,{\blur15.0}And on real hardware,
Dialogue: 1,0:04:21.19,0:04:22.19,Enderman字幕中,,0,0,0,,{\blur15.0}听起来就是这样
Dialogue: 2,0:04:21.19,0:04:22.19,Enderman字幕英,,0,0,0,,{\blur15.0}that's how it sounds.
Dialogue: 1,0:04:23.93,0:04:24.71,Enderman字幕中,,0,0,0,,{\blur15.0}还不错
Dialogue: 2,0:04:23.93,0:04:24.71,Enderman字幕英,,0,0,0,,{\blur15.0}Not bad.
Dialogue: 1,0:04:27.53,0:04:28.35,Enderman字幕中,,0,0,0,,{\blur15.0}它要重启了
Dialogue: 2,0:04:27.53,0:04:28.35,Enderman字幕英,,0,0,0,,{\blur15.0}It's gonna restart.
Dialogue: 1,0:04:29.63,0:04:30.73,Enderman字幕中,,0,0,0,,{\blur15.0}我需要帮它吗？
Dialogue: 2,0:04:29.63,0:04:30.73,Enderman字幕英,,0,0,0,,{\blur15.0}Do I need to help it?
Dialogue: 1,0:04:34.12,0:04:35.26,Enderman字幕中,,0,0,0,,{\blur15.0}帮它一下吧
Dialogue: 2,0:04:34.12,0:04:35.26,Enderman字幕英,,0,0,0,,{\blur15.0}Let's help it.
Dialogue: 1,0:04:38.56,0:04:42.64,Enderman字幕中,,0,0,0,,{\blur15.0}所以 在真实硬件上这就是2989
Dialogue: 2,0:04:38.56,0:04:42.64,Enderman字幕英,,0,0,0,,{\blur15.0}So yeah, that's 2989 on a real hardware.
Dialogue: 1,0:04:46.98,0:04:51.54,Enderman字幕中,,0,0,0,,{\blur15.0}那是MSI Vector 17HX
Dialogue: 2,0:04:46.98,0:04:51.54,Enderman字幕英,,0,0,0,,{\blur15.0}That was MSI Vector 17HX.
Dialogue: 1,0:04:54.34,0:04:56.76,Enderman字幕中,,0,0,0,,{\blur15.0}其实不太依赖硬件
Dialogue: 2,0:04:54.34,0:04:56.76,Enderman字幕英,,0,0,0,,{\blur15.0}It's not really gonna be hardware dependent.
Dialogue: 1,0:04:58.70,0:05:01.66,Enderman字幕中,,0,0,0,,{\blur15.0}绘制窗口需要一点资源
Dialogue: 2,0:04:58.70,0:05:01.66,Enderman字幕英,,0,0,0,,{\blur15.0}Needs a little bit of resources to draw the windows.
Dialogue: 1,0:05:03.42,0:05:05.34,Enderman字幕中,,0,0,0,,{\blur15.0}对 就是这样
Dialogue: 2,0:05:03.42,0:05:05.34,Enderman字幕英,,0,0,0,,{\blur15.0}Yeah, that's how it is.
Dialogue: 1,0:05:06.66,0:05:07.80,Enderman字幕中,,0,0,0,,{\blur15.0}感谢观看
Dialogue: 2,0:05:06.66,0:05:07.80,Enderman字幕英,,0,0,0,,{\blur15.0}Thanks for watching.
